WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.084
Perda stared at the tiny frozen woman.

2
00:00:03.085 --> 00:00:06.652
"That must be the Roodian queen!" she exclaimed.

3
00:00:06.653 --> 00:00:10.794
Zann spun around, his eyes searching the icy cave.

4
00:00:10.795 --> 00:00:14.885
"But where are my parents?" he cried. "They should be here!

5
00:00:14.886 --> 00:00:17.610
The queen was with them in my dream!"

6
00:00:17.611 --> 00:00:21.266
"Let's get the queen free, and maybe she can tell us."

7
00:00:21.267 --> 00:00:27.154
Venna turned to Wyssa. "What do you think? Should we try an Extraction spell?"

8
00:00:27.155 --> 00:00:37.971
Wyssa frowned and stroked her chin. "That could injure her if there are any imperfections in the ice. What about a Supplanting spell?"

9
00:00:37.972 --> 00:00:42.022
"Do you think you can manage that?" Venna sounded doubtful.

10
00:00:42.023 --> 00:00:45.343
"If we don't get the dimensions exactly right . . ."

11
00:00:45.344 --> 00:00:48.876
Zing bounded over and sniffed at the trapped queen.

12
00:00:48.877 --> 00:00:53.540
He whistled curiously, and a wisp of flame escaped his mouth.

13
00:00:53.541 --> 00:00:58.189
"Careful, Zing," Darb said. "Don't burn her."

14
00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:02.811
"No, wait, look." Gliss pointed. "He's melting the ice!"

15
00:01:02.812 --> 00:01:06.256
"Go, Zing," Zann urged. "Keep melting it!"

16
00:01:06.257 --> 00:01:13.814
The little dragon breathed on the block of ice, which quickly melted. Within seconds the queen was free.

17
00:01:13.815 --> 00:01:21.146
Perda grinned. "Good job, Zing. That was much easier than using any of those complicated spells."

18
00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:27.248
"Thank you!" the queen said breathlessly, shaking icy droplets from her clothes.

19
00:01:27.249 --> 00:01:30.999
"But please! You have to stop him!"

20
00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:35.986
Venna nodded. "We know. Morb already tried to take over Magica once."

21
00:01:35.987 --> 00:01:44.613
The queen shook her head. "He's not trying to take over your world this time," she said. "He's trying to destroy it!" "What?"

22
00:01:44.614 --> 00:01:46.951
Gliss exclaimed. "Destroy

23
00:01:46.952 --> 00:01:49.910
it?" Zann said. "How?" Venna

24
00:01:49.911 --> 00:01:53.175
shook her head. "Impossible," she said. "Yes,

25
00:01:53.176 --> 00:01:57.848
the Horn of the Otherworld is one of the most powerful relics known. But

26
00:01:57.849 --> 00:02:05.760
Morb is crazy if he thinks he can use it to destroy an entire world. It doesn't have that much power." "Not

27
00:02:05.761 --> 00:02:09.183
on its own," Wyssa said slowly. "Don't

28
00:02:09.184 --> 00:02:13.390
you know where the Horn came from originally?" Venna

29
00:02:13.391 --> 00:02:17.071
shrugged. "A faraway world of powerful magic. That's

30
00:02:17.072 --> 00:02:19.745
all the ancient texts say about it." "Where

31
00:02:19.746 --> 00:02:22.675
did it come from?" Perda asked Wyssa. Wyssa

32
00:02:22.676 --> 00:02:28.500
looked grim. "From the head of the Beast of the Otherworld." "What?"

33
00:02:28.501 --> 00:02:33.661
Gliss shuddered. "You mean that horrible thing outside?" Darb

34
00:02:33.662 --> 00:02:37.309
frowned. "But the Beast didn't have any horns." "Exactly,"

35
00:02:37.310 --> 00:02:44.281
Wyssa said. "It originally had two horns growing from its head. According

36
00:02:44.282 --> 00:02:51.942
to legend, it fought a terrible battle long ago with a Forellian deathshifter. That's

37
00:02:51.943 --> 00:02:58.134
how it lost the horn you've seen, the one that later became a relic in Magica." "And

38
00:02:58.135 --> 00:03:00.796
the second horn?" Zann said. Wyssa

39
00:03:00.797 --> 00:03:04.338
shrugged. "That part is a mystery. The

40
00:03:04.339 --> 00:03:08.107
legends don't mention anything about the second horn. So

41
00:03:08.108 --> 00:03:14.649
as far as I know, the Beast still had it until very recently." "Yes,"

42
00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:23.223
said the Roodian queen. "Recently Morb disabled the Beast long enough to cut off the remaining horn." Zann

43
00:03:23.224 --> 00:03:29.521
remembered the dark stuff dripping from the Beast's head and realized it must have been blood. "But

44
00:03:29.522 --> 00:03:33.465
how did Morb disable the Beast?" asked Darb. The

45
00:03:33.466 --> 00:03:40.690
queen pointed to the mibbit, which was peeking out from Darb's arms. "He used that creature." "Of

46
00:03:40.691 --> 00:03:44.440
course, I should have guessed," Wyssa muttered. "The

47
00:03:44.441 --> 00:03:52.064
mibbit is probably the only creature in all the known worlds that could overcome the Beast's powerful magic." "What

48
00:03:52.065 --> 00:03:55.298
about a scatter beast?" Venna said. "Well,

49
00:03:55.299 --> 00:03:59.696
yes, that would work too." Wyssa looked thoughtful. "But

50
00:03:59.697 --> 00:04:04.247
Morb would have trouble controlling a scatter beast safely. Since

51
00:04:04.248 --> 00:04:07.547
he's a Void, a mibbit would be—" A

52
00:04:07.548 --> 00:04:10.024
sudden whooshing sound cut her off. Gliss

53
00:04:10.025 --> 00:04:14.147
screamed. "Something just ripped my sleeve!" Zann

54
00:04:14.148 --> 00:04:20.875
ducked as a tiny shape zipped past his face, missing him by the width of a dragon's scale. Spinning

55
00:04:20.876 --> 00:04:30.144
around, he saw a lizard with a sharp blade for a snout, which was embedded in the icy wall. It was already pulling itself free. "Blade

56
00:04:30.145 --> 00:04:36.221
lizards from Redsea," Wyssa said. "Morb has always liked those." "Run!"

57
00:04:36.222 --> 00:04:38.393
Perda cried. "No,

58
00:04:38.394 --> 00:04:46.364
join hands!" Wyssa ordered. "Blade lizards are too fast. We have to zap away." Zap

59
00:04:46.365 --> 00:04:47.919
!

60
00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:49.749
Splash

61
00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:55.912
! "Drat!" said Zann. "I always . . ." His whole body froze before he could

62
00:04:55.913 --> 00:05:01.820
finish. Constant shocks were passing through him, making it impossible to move or even

63
00:05:01.821 --> 00:05:05.277
think. "Zann!" Perda cried. "What's

64
00:05:05.278 --> 00:05:08.959
wrong?" "Hold on, boy," Wyssa called. "I've got

65
00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:12.403
you." Zann felt himself being levitated out of the

66
00:05:12.404 --> 00:05:16.035
water. By the time he landed, the shocks were wearing

67
00:05:16.036 --> 00:05:23.147
off. Finally he could look around. The whole group was in a small courtyard with an ornate fountain in the middle.

68
00:05:23.148 --> 00:05:25.442
"What happened?" Zann asked.

69
00:05:25.443 --> 00:05:32.718
"Paralyzer pythons," Wyssa said. "It's a good thing you were the only one who landed in the water."

70
00:05:32.719 --> 00:05:38.895
"Yeah," Zann muttered, glancing at the creatures writhing in the fountain. "Good thing."

71
00:05:38.896 --> 00:05:42.013
"This is bad," Wyssa said.

72
00:05:42.014 --> 00:05:48.866
"It sure is!" Gliss exclaimed. "How many creatures does Morb have guarding this place, anyway?"

73
00:05:48.867 --> 00:05:52.048
"I'm not talking about the pythons, girl."

74
00:05:52.049 --> 00:05:56.712
Wyssa waved a hand dismissively. "I'm talking about Morb's plan.

75
00:05:56.713 --> 00:06:04.876
If he gets his hands on both horns at the same time, his power will be absolutely unimaginable."

76
00:06:04.877 --> 00:06:14.297
"Yes." Venna sounded anxious. "And thanks to that Possession spell he placed on me, the second horn is probably already here in Rood.

77
00:06:14.298 --> 00:06:20.704
But I still don't understand. How is he planning to use the horns to destroy Magica?"

78
00:06:20.705 --> 00:06:24.423
The Roodian queen spoke up. "I think I know.

79
00:06:24.424 --> 00:06:34.254
The servants here in the fortress have been whispering about a terrible contraption Morb is building. He calls it a Memory Eater."

80
00:06:34.255 --> 00:06:37.111
"That sounds familiar." Venna bit her lip.

81
00:06:37.112 --> 00:06:42.465
"I think it's mentioned in the ancient texts. But I'm not sure how it works."

82
00:06:42.466 --> 00:06:47.424
"Do you know any more about this contraption?" Wyssa asked the queen.

83
00:06:47.425 --> 00:06:53.146
"Only that Morb has brought prisoners from his home world to power it," the queen said.

84
00:06:53.147 --> 00:06:57.218
"A man and a woman named Nax and Asta."

85
00:06:57.219 --> 00:07:03.820
Zann gasped. "My parents!"

